OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1785845913
OL,3,CSidecars to return to Isle of Man TT
OL,4,Cwith 'controlled return to competition'
OL,6,FSidecars are set to return to the Isle
OL,7,Fof Man TT, after a report concluded
OL,8,Fthere is a "credible pathway" to bring
OL,9,Fthe class back to the Mountain Course.
OL,11,FThe review was commissioned after the
OL,12,Fimmediate suspension of the class at
OL,13,Fthe 2026 TT races, following a crash
OL,14,Fin qualifying week.
OL,16,FIt found sidecars can return to the
OL,17,FTT, providing there is "meaningful
OL,18,Fchange" through a "phased programme of
OL,19,Freform".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
