OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1785845913
OL,3,CSidecars to return to Isle of Man TT
OL,4,Cwith 'controlled return to competition'
OL,6,FThis would include work around
OL,7,Freducing overall performance,
OL,8,Fenhancing scrutineering, and refining
OL,9,Fthe technical regulations.
OL,11,FThe review included more than 460
OL,12,Fsubmissions from the public, as well
OL,13,Fas dedicated panels involving
OL,14,Fcompetitors, technical specialists and
OL,15,Frepresentatives from across the race
OL,16,Forganisation.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1785845913
OL,3,CSidecars to return to Isle of Man TT
OL,4,Cwith 'controlled return to competition'
OL,6,FOrganisers say a longer-term programme
OL,7,Fwill examine areas including
OL,8,Faerodynamics, chassis development and
OL,9,Ffuture technical concepts through
OL,10,Fevidence-led engineering work.
OL,12,FGary Thompson MBE, BEM, TT Clerk of
OL,13,Fthe Course said: "The purpose of this
OL,14,FReview has never been to decide
OL,15,Fwhether Sidecars should simply return
OL,16,For disappear.
OL,18,F"Our responsibility has been to
OL,19,Funderstand the challenges facing the
OL,20,Fclass and determine whether there is a
OL,21,Fcredible and sustainable way forward.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1785845913
OL,3,CSidecars to return to Isle of Man TT
OL,4,Cwith 'controlled return to competition'
OL,6,F"The evidence gathered over recent
OL,7,Fweeks has been extensive and,
OL,8,Fimportantly, remarkably consistent.
OL,9,FThere remains enormous affection for
OL,10,FSidecar racing and recognition of its
OL,11,Funique place within the TT.
OL,13,F"At the same time, there is broad
OL,14,Facceptance that meaningful change is
OL,15,Frequired if the class is to thrive
OL,16,Finto the future.
OL,18,F"This report does not represent the
OL,19,Fend of the process. It marks the end
OL,20,Fof the first stage.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1785845913
OL,3,CSidecars to return to Isle of Man TT
OL,4,Cwith 'controlled return to competition'
OL,6,F"Our focus now turns to working with
OL,7,Fcompetitors, constructors, governing
OL,8,Fbodies and technical experts to
OL,9,Fdevelop an initial package of reforms
OL,10,Fthat can be delivered within an
OL,11,Fappropriate timeframe, while
OL,12,Fcontinuing the longer-term engineering
OL,13,Fwork that will shape the future
OL,14,Fdirection of the class."
OL,16,FThis review concludes the first stage
OL,17,Fof the investigation, with further
OL,18,Fupdates due in the coming months.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/5
